      "html": "<p>Large males, 12-15 cm long, of this spectacular species of barb are currently on offer, imported from Hong Kong. Smaller specimens (7-10 cm, both sexes) are also available.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "maintenance",
      "source": "glaser",
